# In-Tour Operations — Feature Value Audit

**Session:** `in-tour-value-audit-20260905`  
**Branch:** `feature/tour-attendance-producer` @ `5f3f09ff`  
**Goal:** Small, activatable core for many clubs — not every possible ops feature.

---

## Executive summary

Current build **over-ships OPTIONAL UI by default** (groups, checklists, incident log, full state machine) while **under-shipping two CORE items** (attendance on the operations desk, Excel export).

**Recommendation:** Shrink default operator UI to CORE; gate OPTIONAL via workspace theme/manifest (`inTourOps.*`, default off); keep backend tables for enabled workspaces only.

**No implementation in this audit turn** — next slice: `REFACTOR-01` + `ITO-C03` + `ITO-C07` only.

---

## Classification

### CORE (always when operations module enabled)

| ID | Capability | Owner | 2+ consumers? | Status |
| -- | ---------- | ----- | ------------- | ------ |
| ITO-C01 | Final participant manifest | Platform tour ops | Yes (desk + portal) | Built |
| ITO-C02 | Payment / insurance readiness columns | Platform | Yes (desk + finance tab) | Built |
| ITO-C03 | Attendance on manifest rows | Platform bookings | Yes (desk + MNI) | **API only — UI gap** |
| ITO-C04 | Tour leader assignment | Platform | Yes (auth + member summary) | Partial UI |
| ITO-C05 | Schedule / location change + notify | Platform MNI | Yes (portal + inbox) | Built |
| ITO-C06 | Member in-app notifications | Platform MNI | Yes (inbox + detail) | Partial proof |
| ITO-C07 | Excel manifest export | Platform | Yes (operator + external coordinator) | **Missing** |

### OPTIONAL (workspace flag, default **off**, no UI when off)

| ID | Flag | Owner | Notes |
| -- | ---- | ----- | ----- |
| ITO-O01 | `inTourOps.groups` | Workspace | Large tours; **currently always shown — trim** |
| ITO-O02 | `inTourOps.checklists` | Workspace | SOP clubs; **trim** |
| ITO-O03 | `inTourOps.incidentLog` | Workspace | Post-tour review; **trim** |
| ITO-O04 | `inTourOps.pdfExport` | Workspace | Defer until Excel CORE |
| ITO-O05 | `inTourOps.multiSupervisor` | Workspace | Defer |
| ITO-O06 | — | Workspace | Use existing **transport tab** — do not duplicate |
| ITO-O07 | `notifications.sms` | Notifications product | Out of ITO scope |

### DEFERRED (do not build now)

| ID | Reason |
| -- | ------ |
| ITO-D01 | Live GPS — cost/complexity, no proven club demand |
| ITO-D02 | Expose full 7-state FSM in default UI — confuse small clubs; backend may keep states, UI simplified |
| ITO-D03 | Group-leader attendance auth — security slice 2 |
| ITO-D04 | Emergency SOS — product/safety gate |
| ITO-D05 | Operator dashboard home chip — second surface; after CORE stable |

---

## Per-capability audit (CORE sample)

### ITO-C01 — Final participant manifest

| Dimension | Assessment |
| --------- | ---------- |
| Real users | Admin, tour leader |
| Problem | Stale WhatsApp/Excel lists vs approved roster |
| E2E | Approve registrations → lock manifest → day-of roster stable |
| Data | `operator_registrations` → `tour_execution_manifest_rows` |
| Alternative | Registrations tab + manual Excel |
| Ops value | **High** |
| Complexity | Low (shipped) |
| Consumers | Operator desk, portal execution summary |

### ITO-C03 — Attendance (CORE gap)

| Dimension | Assessment |
| --------- | ---------- |
| Real users | Tour leader at departure |
| Problem | Headcount / missing guests |
| E2E | Tap present/absent on manifest row → DP-7 → live column |
| Data | `POST /bookings/:id/attendance` (existing) |
| Alternative | Bookings command center (different tab) |
| Ops value | **High** |
| Complexity | Medium (UI wire only) |
| Consumers | Operations desk, notification producer |

**Action:** Build — owner Platform bookings; evidence: browser + Postgres attendance join.

### ITO-C07 — Excel export (CORE gap)

| Dimension | Assessment |
| --------- | ---------- |
| Real users | Admin, external bus coordinator |
| Problem | Offline handoff without copy-paste |
| E2E | Locked manifest → Download XLSX |
| Data | Manifest projection + attendance |
| Alternative | Manual Excel |
| Ops value | **High** for transport-heavy clubs |
| Complexity | Medium (new export endpoint) |
| Consumers | Operator, external partner |

**Action:** Build — owner Platform; evidence: file download test.

---

## UI / UX — progressive disclosure

Mirror **finance tab gating** (`ensureFinanceNavSupported`):

1. **Operations tab** visible only if workspace execution ops module enabled.
2. **Default panel:** state banner, leader picker, manifest table, notify-change (collapsed), export.
3. **Never render** disabled optional cards (groups/checklists/events) — remove from DOM when flag false.
4. **Mobile / RTL:** stacked cards; FA via existing `tours.workspace.operations` keys.
5. **Empty:** link to registrations tab — not empty operations forms.

---

## Current build violations

```text
apps/web/src/features/tours/tour-workspace-logic.ts
  → operations in TOUR_WORKSPACE_CORE_SUBNAV_TABS (always on)

apps/web/src/features/tours/tour-workspace-operations-client.tsx
  → groups, checklist, events cards always mounted
```

